{"3072120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Backrooms Lost Runners", "steam_appid": 3072120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Backrooms Lost Runners</strong> is a cooperative survival-horror experience where teamwork is your only real weapon  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and even your voice can put you in danger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trapped inside the endless corridors of the Backrooms, you and your friends must explore abandoned camps, solve environmental puzzles, manage scarce resources, and survive encounters with entities that react to sound, light, and movement. Every dark hallway hides a threat. Every whisper can give you away. Every wrong decision can separate the group forever.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/9a2cb2dc3884732319ea57efdf8884b4.avif?t=1781718736\" width=616 height=199 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Immersive Horror Atmosphere</strong><br>Venture through dimly lit corridors, abandoned shelters, and unstable spaces filled with oppressive silence, dynamic lighting, and realistic sound design. In the Backrooms, every footstep matters  and every moment of silence feels wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/749c429075a34e6fab9803326aa87326.avif?t=1781718736\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cooperative Survival</strong><br>Survival depends on communication, trust, and coordination. Share resources, split responsibilities, solve puzzles together, and make difficult choices as a team. Staying together is safer  but sometimes the best loot is found far from the group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/1cbe3043916d1a7a186575ccb119267d.poster.avif?t=1781718736\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/1cbe3043916d1a7a186575ccb119267d.webm?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/1cbe3043916d1a7a186575ccb119267d.mp4?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>True Cooperative Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collaboration is crucial for survival. Manage your resources, coordinate tactics via voice chat, and make collective choices.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/ac76f46e05b3ca3861056ac996016769.avif?t=1781718736\" width=616 height=199 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/a52ddeb9354ea90846528b17b9fa3ee6.avif?t=1781718736\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Voice-Reactive Threats</strong><br>Face entities with different behaviors and weaknesses. Some react to sound. Some hunt through darkness. Some appear when your mind starts to break. Learn how they behave, stay quiet when needed, and use your environment to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/7b41c8f5bcf2064c1e0c2df1cea14dc5.poster.avif?t=1781718736\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/7b41c8f5bcf2064c1e0c2df1cea14dc5.webm?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/7b41c8f5bcf2064c1e0c2df1cea14dc5.mp4?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/5ce1b27e95416667535ee2365394d713.avif?t=1781718736\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sanity System </strong><br>Darkness, fear, isolation, and supernatural events affect your mental state. Stay near light, heat sources, and safe areas to slow sanity loss. If your mind collapses, the Backrooms will begin to change around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tesseract Afterlife</strong><br>Death is not the end. When you die, you are pulled into a surreal Tesseract realm where you must find a way back to life. But returning may cost you time, resources, and the safety of your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/ab882ddb9d159dd300a25329a5e904d8.poster.avif?t=1781718736\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/ab882ddb9d159dd300a25329a5e904d8.webm?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/ab882ddb9d159dd300a25329a5e904d8.mp4?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/e5bae9165ca2555bd0d5875174b07111.avif?t=1781718736\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Storyline &amp; Quest System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover journals, audio recordings, floppy disks, and unsettling traces of survivors. Piece together the timeline of the catastrophe, uncover the fates of those who were here before you, and find out what is really happening inside the Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/96c90b31f56b0ef1db6f2a45f1b62b39.poster.avif?t=1781718736\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/96c90b31f56b0ef1db6f2a45f1b62b39.webm?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/96c90b31f56b0ef1db6f2a45f1b62b39.mp4?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/f454a3676741ac862dcc51ff388a4311.avif?t=1781718736\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Resource Management &amp; Character Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scavenge for food, clothing, and tools to maintain health, stamina, and sanity. Will you risk venturing alone for high-value loot, or stick close to your squad?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find valuable items and resources by exploring camps, lockers, and shelters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/aeb8133e49d0fae4409ad9fa2aeac34b.poster.avif?t=1781718736\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/aeb8133e49d0fae4409ad9fa2aeac34b.webm?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/aeb8133e49d0fae4409ad9fa2aeac34b.mp4?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/544820b4463eebe450e13dcf20844ccb.avif?t=1781718736\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Reality-Bending Anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Zero-gravity zones, sudden teleportation gates, shifting walls, broken physics, and impossible spaces will force you to question what is real. In the Backrooms, the environment itself can become the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/ebfe1584d543ef13a577d76de963e02b.poster.avif?t=1781718736\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/ebfe1584d543ef13a577d76de963e02b.webm?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/ebfe1584d543ef13a577d76de963e02b.mp4?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>YOUR ADVENTURE IS JUST BEGINNING.</u></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/b8bcc8b05d1ae37a0aca2e6e44a1f3c6.avif?t=1781718736\" width=616 height=199 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Backrooms Lost Runners</strong> is a cooperative survival-horror experience where teamwork is your only real weapon  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and even your voice can put you in danger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trapped inside the endless corridors of the Backrooms, you and your friends must explore abandoned camps, solve environmental puzzles, manage scarce resources, and survive encounters with entities that react to sound, light, and movement. Every dark hallway hides a threat. Every whisper can give you away. Every wrong decision can separate the group forever.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/9a2cb2dc3884732319ea57efdf8884b4.avif?t=1781718736\" width=616 height=199 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Immersive Horror A