//shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/96c90b31f56b0ef1db6f2a45f1b62b39.webm?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/96c90b31f56b0ef1db6f2a45f1b62b39.mp4?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/f454a3676741ac862dcc51ff388a4311.avif?t=1781718736\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Resource Management &amp; Character Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scavenge for food, clothing, and tools to maintain health, stamina, and sanity. Will you risk venturing alone for high-value loot, or stick close to your squad?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find valuable items and resources by exploring camps, lockers, and shelters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/aeb8133e49d0fae4409ad9fa2aeac34b.poster.avif?t=1781718736\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/aeb8133e49d0fae4409ad9fa2aeac34b.webm?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/aeb8133e49d0fae4409ad9fa2aeac34b.mp4?t=1781718736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong> <br><sp